 {r}←{enforceCompile}Selfie parms
⍝ `parms` must either be a parameter space or an empty vector (`⍬`).
 enforceCompile←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'enforceCompile'
 :If 0=≢parms
     parms←##.Laguntza.CreateParms''
     parms.folderName←'expand'##.FilesAndDirs.NormalizePath'Help\'
     '.\',##.FilesAndDirs.NormalizePath'Help\'   ⍝TODO⍝
     parms.helpAbout←'APL GUI Utilities' 'Written by Kai Jaeger' 'Copyright APL Team Ltd'
     parms.helpCaption←'APLGUI'
     parms.helpVersion←1⊃##.APLGUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version
     parms.helpVersionDate←2⊃##.APLGUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version
     :If 0=##.FilesAndDirs.IsDir parms.folderName
         ⍝ Huuh?!
     :EndIf
     parms.source←##.APLGUI_Help
 :EndIf
 r←enforceCompile ##.Laguntza.New parms
⍝Done
